WEBVTT

00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:32.132
has increased by 40 percent

00:01:32.156 --> 00:01:34.926
just in the last 150 years or so.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:40.870
Human actions are now releasing
9.4 billion metric tons of carbon

00:01:40.894 --> 00:01:42.672
into the atmosphere,

00:01:42.696 --> 00:01:46.020
from activities
such as burning fossil fuels

00:01:46.044 --> 00:01:49.021
and intensive agricultural practices,

00:01:49.045 --> 00:01:51.878
and other ways we change
the way we use land,

00:01:51.902 --> 00:01:53.591
including deforestation.

00:01:55.254 --> 00:02:00.636
But the concentration of carbon dioxide
that stays in the atmosphere